# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# PROFILE - GET & UPDATE (HAPPY PATH)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Duplicate-email/phone and invalid-format conflict checks split out to the sibling
# profile-update-conflicts.http (same disposable-mechanic naming convention) to stay <= 250 lines.

@AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress = {{$processEnv AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}
@WebUI_Origin = {{$processEnv ARSM_TEST_WEBUI_ORIGIN}}
@ProfileMechanicEmail = {{$processEnv ARSM_TEST_MECHANIC_EMAIL}}
@ProfileCurrentPassword = {{$processEnv ARSM_TEST_MECHANIC_PASSWORD}}
# Phone digits derived from this run's id so registrations never collide with another file or an
# earlier, aborted run (the unique-phone constraint would answer 400 instead of 200).
@ProfileRunId = {{$timestamp}}
@PhoneTail = {{ProfileRunId.toString().slice(-6)}}
@PhoneTail7 = {{ProfileRunId.toString().slice(-7)}}


# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### [Setup][Profile] Clear any session cookie left by a previous file (204 or 401, not asserted)
POST {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/auth/logout
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}

###

### [Setup][Profile] Login as non-admin mechanic (session prerequisite)
POST {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{ProfileMechanicEmail}}",
  "password": "{{ProfileCurrentPassword}}"
}

?? status == 200

###

### [Positive][Profile] Get own profile (200 expected)
GET {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/profile

?? status == 200

###

### [Positive][Profile] Update own profile (middle name only) (200 expected)
PUT {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/profile
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": null,
  "phoneNumber": null,
  "middleName": "TestMiddle"
}

?? status == 200

###

### [Positive][Profile] Update first and last name (200 expected)
PUT {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/profile
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "UpdatedFirst",
  "lastName": "UpdatedLast"
}

?? status == 200

###

### [Positive][Profile] Update all name fields together (200 expected)
PUT {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/profile
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "UpdatedFirst",
  "middleName": "UpdatedMiddle",
  "lastName": "UpdatedLast"
}

?? status == 200

###

### [Positive][Profile] Update phone with local format (default region normalization) (200 expected)
PUT {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/profile
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": null,
  "phoneNumber": "304{{PhoneTail}}",
  "middleName": "TestMiddle"
}

?? status == 200

###

### [Setup][Profile] Logout after happy-path profile checks
POST {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/auth/logout
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}

?? status == 204
